{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34402","headline":"奉和袭美怀华阳润卿博士三首 二 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美怀华阳润卿博士三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"火景应难到洞宫，萧闲堂冷任天风。\n谈玄麈尾抛云底，服散龙胎在酒中。\n有路还将赤城接，无泉不共紫河通。\n奇编早晚教传授，免以神仙问葛洪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34402.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34402","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}